  propositions, and technical findings, cite the applicable
  originating DOI-bearing publications. To reference this
  GitHub repository as a scientific directory and secondary
  preservation record, use the repository citation provided here.

authors:
  - family-names: "Tonucci"
    given-names: "Cara"
