    affiliation: "Somatic Rising Institute"

title: "Structural Stability Science (SSS): Scientific Repository and Source Navigation"

abstract: >-
  Secondary scientific repository providing technical reference,
  preservation, publication navigation, and source-provenance
  information for Structural Stability Science (SSS). The
  repository documents the foundational scientific architecture,
  including the Structural Identification Method (SIM),
  Dimensional Human Field Theory (DHFT), Dimensional Human
  Physics (DHP), and Dimensional Self Architecture (DSA).
  It also provides navigation to the independent mathematical
  research program, including order preservation, admissibility,
  mathematical analysis, dynamical systems, Navier-Stokes
  investigations, operator theory, and observability.
  Independent mathematical research retains its own
  publication lineage, mathematical assumptions, results,
  and research status. Institutional inclusion within SSS
  does not establish mathematical derivation from DHFT.
  Individual DOI-bearing scientific and mathematical
  publications retain primary source authority.
  Somatic Rising Institute (SRI) provides institutional
  scientific stewardship and research access.

